  "correction": "Foundation 22 removed one mapping fact (whether the binding had selected the type) from these PURE_XNA_DERIVED rows; every XNA fact they record is unchanged. Foundation 23 made bcl_projection.register pin only the identities Foundation 21 established, so a growing register never rewrites it."
